# Del Groups ERP Rules
- Tech Stack: Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Supabase (PostgreSQL).
- Canonical schema reference: `types/schema.sql`
- Database Schema reference:
  - Table `products`: code, name, category, subcategory, unit, buy_price, sell_price, stock, min_stock, barcode, color, weight, extra_info, warehouse_id.
  - Table `customers`: code, full_name, name, phone, company_name, address, voen, balance.
  - Table `sales`: header fields (doc_no, doc_date, customer_id, customer_name, seller_id, seller_name, warehouse_name, subtotal, discount_total, vat_total, total_amount, paid_amount, remaining_balance, delivery_type, delivery_address, delivery_fee, notes, note, payments JSONB).
  - Table `sale_items`: normalized line items linked by sale_id (product_id, quantity, unit_price, discount_percent, vat_rate, line_total, etc.).
  - Table `warehouses`: code, name, location, is_default.
  - Table `categories`: name, parent_id.
  - Table `inventory_writeoffs`: document_number, warehouse_id, checker_name, writeoff_date, notes, items JSONB, created_at.
  - Table `commission_rules`: category_name, min_sales, max_sales, commission_rate.
  - Table `consignment_orders`: customer_name, seller_name, product_name, category_name, sent_qty, sold_qty, returned_qty, remaining_qty, unit_price.

## DreamScore UI Design System (strict)

- DESIGN SYSTEM: Enforce DreamScore UI standards. Base background must be `bg-slate-50`. Cards must use `bg-white border border-slate-200/80 rounded-xl shadow-sm p-5`.
- BUTTONS: Absolutely NO color gradients (purple, cyan, etc.). Primary buttons MUST use solid corporate blue (`bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-lg`). Secondary buttons use `bg-slate-100 text-slate-700`. ALWAYS use `@/components/ui/button` variants (default, secondary, outline, destructive).
- FORM LAYOUTS: Complex form pages (Sales Invoices, Purchases, New Products) MUST use a 12-column grid: `lg:col-span-8` for primary inputs and `lg:col-span-4` for sticky right-side summaries (`sticky top-6`).
- DATA TABLES: All tables MUST have high density (`py-2.5`), slate header background (`bg-slate-50`), crisp borders (`border border-slate-200`), rounded corners, and a single 3-dot dropdown menu for row actions.
- CARDS: ALL sections in forms and dashboards MUST be wrapped in `@/components/ui/card` components. Do not use raw div containers with custom shadows or borders.
